cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CZ Silicon Melt CFD Reference Dataset - Crystal Rotation Sweep"
abstract: >
  CFD reference dataset for Czochralski (CZ) silicon melt growth, covering
  crystal rotation from 4 to 20 rpm across 11 cases. All cases use the same
  anchor point (crystal 8 rpm, crucible -3 rpm, hot wall 1745 K) and were
  checked for convergence, mesh independence, conservation, and physical
  consistency. A flow reversal in the meridional circulation was found
  between 6 and 7 rpm. The data was generated as reference input for a PINN
  and surrogate model being developed under the Quasi / SIMD project.
  Simulated using ANSYS Fluent 2026 R1.
